# Proctor — Website Design System

Guard visual consistency. Match existing patterns before inventing new ones.

## Stack

- **Tailwind CSS** for styling (not inline styles or new CSS files unless unavoidable)
- **shadcn/ui** primitives in `src/components/ui/`
- **MUI** only where already used (icons, CMS, some landing sections)
- **Plus Jakarta Sans** via `--font-jakarta` / `font-body` — do not add new font families

## Color tokens (use these, not raw hex)

| Token                                  | Use                                               |
| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| `bg-parchment` / `#F4F7FF`             | Page background (`bg-background` is shadcn white) |
| `text-text1` / `navy` `#212E42`        | Headings, primary text                            |
| `text-text2` / `text-text3`            | Body, muted text                                  |
| `primary1` / `maple` `#316BFF`         | Primary CTAs, links                               |
| `secondary2` / `amber-light` `#F4845F` | Secondary accent                                  |
| `success` `#0DAA94`                    | Positive states                                   |
| `error1` `#EE4266`                     | Errors                                            |

Reference: `tailwind.config.js`. Redesign spec (MUI tokens) lives in `docs/ui/celpip-ui-redesign/theme/theme.ts` — align new marketing work to the live Tailwind palette above.

## Components

- **Buttons**: `@/components/v2/Button` (rounded-full, shadow offset) — not raw `<button>` on marketing/dashboard surfaces
- **Public pages**: wrap in `PublicPageShell` (`bg-[#F4F7FF]`, `TopHeader`, `pt-[88px]`)
- **Landing sections**: `src/components/pages/landing/` and `landing/home/`
- **Dashboard chrome**: `dashboard-new/LayoutClient`, `BottomNavigation`, `DesktopNavigation`
- **Pricing**: `src/components/pages/pricing/` — reuse `PricingNavModal`, checkout tiles

## Layout & responsive

- Breakpoints: `screen744`, `screen1024`, `screen1280`, `screen1440` (not default `sm`/`md`/`lg` on marketing pages)
- Cards: rounded corners (12–16px), subtle border/shadow — see existing `ExamSectionCard`, pricing tiles
- Section spacing: generous vertical padding; match neighboring sections

## Do not

- Introduce one-off hex colors when a token exists
- Add a second button style on the same page type
- Use MUI `ThemeProvider` on new marketing pages (Tailwind-first)
- Create standalone CSS modules for components that can use Tailwind + `cn()`

## Examples

```tsx
// ✅ Public marketing page
<PublicPageShell>
  <section className="mx-auto max-w-screen1280 px-4 screen744:px-8">
    <h1 className="font-display text-text1 text-3xl screen744:text-5xl">...</h1>
    <Button href="/sign-up" variant="primary" size="lg">Start Free</Button>
  </section>
</PublicPageShell>

// ❌ Avoid
<button className="bg-blue-500 rounded px-4">Start Free</button>
```
